---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PhoneMockup from '../components/PhoneMockup.astro';
---

<Layout title="Features | Departure: Fitness Quest" description="Departure logs more than 300 exercises in 12 categories and finds your personal records for you. Your workouts earn XP to climb 24 ranks, power a team in monster battles, and unlock daily challenges and gear. The core game is free." ogImage="/social/equipment.jpg">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-16 pb-12 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4">Everything you need to level up.</h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Departure is a serious workout log and a role playing game (RPG) in one app. Here is what you can do in it and how each part works.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Workout Tracking -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-surface/30">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="text-primary-light text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Core Training</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2 mb-4">Serious workout tracking.</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted mb-6">Departure records what you actually did: sets, reps, weight, time and distance. It is built for people who train and want an accurate log of every session.</p>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <span class="text-primary-light text-sm font-bold">12</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-medium text-sm">Exercise Categories</p>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Workouts are sorted into Arms, Chest, Back, Shoulders, Legs, Core, Power, Stamina, Cardio, Flex, Classes and Sports.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <span class="text-primary-light text-sm font-bold">300</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-medium text-sm">Built-in Exercises</p>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">More than 300 exercises are built in, from the major lifts to cardio, classes, sports and stretching. If yours is missing, you can add it.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-gold/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-medium text-sm">Auto PR Detection</p>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">The app finds your personal records (PRs) on its own. For lifts, it estimates your one rep max, the most you could lift once, from the weight and reps you logged. For cardio, it tracks your longest session.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-green/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-medium text-sm">Anti-Cheat System</p>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Rules catch entries that are not believable, such as an impossible weight or a sudden jump far past your usual training, so XP reflects honest work. Every rule is listed in the app.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
          <PhoneMockup src="/screenshots/training-log.png" alt="Training calendar and workout log" class="max-w-[250px]" />
          <PhoneMockup src="/screenshots/workout-log.png" alt="Logging a workout with exercises" class="max-w-[250px] hidden sm:block mt-8" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Training Methods -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="flex justify-center order-2 lg:order-1">
          <PhoneMockup src="/screenshots/equipment.png" alt="Equipment screen where you dress your character in gear" class="max-w-[280px]" />
        </div>
        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
          <span class="text-gold text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Training Methods</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2 mb-4">Train your way.</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted mb-6">Pick one of eight training plans or build your own, then choose the days you train. The app then shows what is planned for each day. The Domestic plan counts household chores as training.</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
            {["Push/Pull/Legs", "Upper/Lower", "Full Body", "Bro Split", "HIIT", "CrossFit", "Tai Chi", "Domestic", "Custom"].map(method => (
              <div class="bg-surface border border-surface-light/50 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center">
                <span class="text-sm font-medium">{method}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RPG System -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-surface/30">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="text-accent text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">RPG System</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2 mb-4">Your body is your character sheet.</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Every workout earns experience points (XP), and XP moves you up 24 ranks. Your training history also builds the four stats below, which decide how much your character adds in battle.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-surface border border-surface-light/50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-red mb-1">STR</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm font-medium mb-2">Strength</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">Strength grows with the total weight you have lifted over time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface border border-surface-light/50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green mb-1">VIT</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm font-medium mb-2">Vitality</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">Vitality grows with consistency: the workouts you finish and how long your weekly streak lasts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface border border-surface-light/50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-accent mb-1">RES</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm font-medium mb-2">Resilience</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">Resilience grows with how hard you push, how long you train, and how many kinds of training you do.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface border border-surface-light/50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-gold mb-1">END</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm font-medium mb-2">Endurance</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">Endurance grows with the minutes you spend on cardio.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-6">8 titles with 3 levels each make 24 ranks</h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          {["Recruit", "Warrior", "Gladiator", "Knight", "Champion", "Warlord", "Conqueror", "Legend"].map((rank, i) => (
            <div class="bg-surface border border-surface-light/50 rounded-full px-4 py-2 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold" style={`color: ${['#94A3B8', '#10B981', '#06B6D4', '#A78BFA', '#F59E0B', '#EF4444', '#F97316', '#FFD700'][i]}`}>{rank}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AI Transformation -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="text-accent text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">AI-Powered</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2 mb-4">Your future self, visualized.</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted mb-6">Take a selfie and set a goal for fat loss or muscle gain. The app uses AI to make a realistic picture of how you could look if you follow your plan, and estimates how long it could take based on your diet, sleep and training.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">You get one free Future Self image a week, and image credits from packs let you make more.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">A timeline estimates when you could reach your target weight and body fat.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">Progress photos show you how far you have come.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">A weekly check-in keeps your plan current, and you can change the plan at any time.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <PhoneMockup src="/screenshots/transformation.png" alt="AI body transformation feature" class="max-w-[280px]" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team & Social -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-surface/30">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
          <PhoneMockup src="/screenshots/team-journey.png" alt="Team journey map showing the monsters in order" class="max-w-[240px]" />
          <PhoneMockup src="/screenshots/team-stats.png" alt="Team stats and roster" class="max-w-[240px] hidden sm:block mt-8" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-red text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Team Arena</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2 mb-4">Stronger together.</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted mb-6">Create or join a team, pick a banner that sets its look, such as Barbarian Horde or Knights of the Realm, and fight the monsters together. Teammates see each other's workouts in a shared feed, where they can react, comment and chat.</p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-light mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">A journey map lays out 24 monsters in six themed worlds, and the team beats them in order.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-light mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">There are 18 team banners, each with its own art. Four are free, five are bought with gold the team wins in battle, and nine come in paid packs.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-light mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">The team feed shows every member's workouts, with reactions and comments.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-light mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">After a team clears a world, tougher versions of its monsters unlock, with bigger rewards.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Challenges & Equipment -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="text-gold text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Daily & Weekly</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2 mb-4">Challenges that keep you sharp.</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted mb-6">Each day and each week, the app offers a challenge workout matched to your training. Finish it to earn bonus XP, coins and a short boost to your stats that makes your character stronger in battle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
          <PhoneMockup src="/screenshots/challenges.png" alt="Daily and weekly challenges" class="max-w-[250px]" />
          <PhoneMockup src="/screenshots/banners.png" alt="Team banners a team can choose from" class="max-w-[250px] hidden sm:block mt-8" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-surface/30">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Start your quest today.</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-lg mb-8">Departure is free to download and play, and it has no ads.</p>
      <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6761634387" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-colors text-lg">
            Download Free on iPhone
          </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
